Package: openmediavault-ro-api
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: admin
Plugin-Section: utilities
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 7.0)
Maintainer: shurushetr <shurushetr@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/shurushetr/openmediavault-ro-api
Description: openmediavault Read-Only API & Infisical Auditor plugin
 Provides a server-enforced Read-Only JSON-RPC endpoint (RoApiProxy::query)
 with granular per-section access controls, automatic password/secret redaction,
 subnet allowlisting, and optional Infisical Universal Auth token synchronization
 without exposing OpenMediaVault administrator credentials.
